{"include_website_name lacks the required `?`, so the serializer never gates the new `website_name` attribute; when `website` is hidden via `untrusted_attributes` for anonymous/TL0 users, `website_name` still comes through and the template renders a link using `model.website` even though it is absent, leaking the website host": 0.7749894261360168, "When the instance hostname is the base domain (e.g. `example.com`) and the user's website is on `www.example.com`, no branch matches and we return just `www.example.com` instead of `www.example.com/user`, so same-site URLs with a `www.` or other subdomain suffix don't get the path appended as intended": 0.8452489972114563}